00:08:25.960 --> 00:08:30.340
Then read the Tokyo Ghoul manga, then watch the Tokyo ghoul live-action then comes the Tokyo Ghoul Musical

00:08:30.460 --> 00:08:35.920
then Tokyo Ghoul Grand Order for the Nintendo DS and then after you've done all that you're finally ready

00:08:35.920 --> 00:08:37.020
to play Kingdom Hearts 3

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:42.760
- my recollection, the only anime original ending that has been positively received has been the original Full Metal Alchemist

00:08:42.760 --> 00:08:48.309
and what made this possible was the fact that since the anime started diverging by the halfway point, it was able to carve out its

00:08:48.310 --> 00:08:54.039
own narrative and tackle things in a different way, giving much more adequate time to set up its ending and for it's time people were

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:58.599
Satisfied considering the original manga was still ongoing. having said that though nowadays

00:08:58.600 --> 00:09:01.480
