which remakes the entire series to give an ending the majority seem to agree was much better than what we originally got and this is

00:09:09.309 --> 00:09:11.889
Why I feel you just don't see this kind of ending nowadays

00:09:11.889 --> 00:09:15.669
If you diverge from the source material. It is very hard to make something satisfactory

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:20.769
even if you make it conclusive and fans seemingly would much rather be left hanging than given a conclusion that

