And that's because I just wanted to express how much I value a great ending

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:15.739
well, I don't think every series needs a fantastic ending or even a proper ending, for it to be a

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:20.240
fantastic series the ones that do have one. I never forget.

